select jsonb_build_object('checked_at',clock_timestamp(),'expected',count(*),'exact',count(*)filter(where exact),'mismatches',coalesce(jsonb_agg(ref)filter(where not coalesce(exact,false)),'[]')) as verification from(select 'catalog_work_descriptions:113' as ref,(select to_jsonb(t) from public.catalog_work_descriptions t where t.work_id=987146054 and t.language='nl')='{"text":"Calli Clark spreekt sinds een ingrijpende gebeurtenis in haar vroege jeugd niet meer. Haar moeder probeert haar te helpen, maar leeft zelf in een gewelddadig huwelijk. Calli''s vriendin Petra begrijpt haar en treedt vaak als haar stem op. Wanneer de twee meisjes tegelijk verdwijnen, valt die vertrouwde manier van contact weg. De mensen om hen heen moeten proberen te achterhalen wat er is gebeurd. Het verhaal brengt de verdwijning samen met de spanningen en stiltes die al langer in hun omgeving bestaan.","work_id":987146054,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work5803 The weight of silence / Heather Gudenkauf and exact Dutch In stilte gehuld 9789032512590 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-028.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p332978443"],"reference":"work:5803","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-028.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17902867W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p332978443"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_