ing nog moeilijker wordt. Dit is het slot van de tweedelige Crimson Moth-reeks.","work_id":987146010,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work3242 Rebel Witch / Kristen Ciccarelli and exact Dutch De rebelse heks 9789020558388 Hardcover. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-029.json retained. Concluding Crimson Moth volume; minimize prior volume revelations and no invented allegiance changes. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p450017141"],"reference":"work:3242","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-029.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42402317W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p450017141"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789020558388","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15166152,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61211456M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42402317W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-047","review_status":"approved",